WEBVTT

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:35.710
"Only the true Emperor can reach the shrine at the summit of Houkyou Mountain."

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:39.950
That's what I heard, and so I entered Kyuusai Cove...

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:44.880
but it looks like I'm lost.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:48.100
What should I do?

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.740
Now I understand what it feels like to be a lost child.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.980
I really do, honestly, Kouyuu.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:59.170
Is someone talking about me?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.440
I wonder if that stupid Emperor has met with Shuuei yet.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.480
Do bring him back.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.770
I can't get a fire started at all.

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:20.990
There aren't any fish in Kyuusai Cove.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.490
I've finally found some mushrooms to grill, but...

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:26.760
This is impossible!

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:31.000
Only the true Emperor can reach the shrine, huh?

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:35.340
Of Saiunkoku, I am...

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:43.800
Do you want this?

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.520
That was a strong wind.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.530
Eight years ago?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.380
It was eight years ago, during a family feud.

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:09.970
After the Emperor fell ill,

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:13.560
the Imperial Court was riven by a family feud, and the government ceased to function.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.810
We were living in the city near the palace and were directly affected by events.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:26.110
Most nobles closed their gates, and the bodies of those who starved to death lay outside their walls.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:31.710
Father and Seiran both did their best to
maintain the livelihood of people in the city,

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.610
but there wasn't much we could do.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.280
Those were fearful days.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.060
Shuurei...

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:43.450
That's why I entered the palace.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:49.290
I don't want to feel regret over being helpless.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:53.790
That's why I thought, "Next time, if there's anything I can do, I'll do it."

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.960
I'm not expecting much, you know.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:04.580
I won't ask for something ridiculous like, "Please make this a country where everyone here lives happily."

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:09.200
It's up to each individual to be happy or sad.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:12.810
How someone lives is their choice.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.170
An Emperor isn't responsible for that.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:19.690
Everyone makes his own choices about life from the many that are available.

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.810
Makes his own choices...

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:28.170
Nonetheless, there are things an ordinary citizen can never do.

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:30.670
The Emperor's job is to do those things, isn't it?

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.360
If the Emperor fails to do his job, who will do it instead of him?

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.900
I don't know why he won't work,

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:42.790
but he's already Emperor, and nothing can be done about that.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.630
So I expect him to do his best.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.390
In exchange, I'll do my best for him.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.680
What?

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.600
I've come here to support you.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:56.360
To stay beside you and support you, so that you'll rise to the task of being Emperor!

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.250
I hate darkness.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.030
Huh?

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:04.630
I don't like to be alone in the dark.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.530
Why?

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:11.700
As a child, I was often locked up... in dark places.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.600
By whom?

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:16.100
By my mother and brothers.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.820
What was going on?

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:20.120
I was an unwanted child.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:20.960
What?

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:24.540
Apparently, I was born in the wrong order.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:29.470
I was the youngest, so my father loved my mother less.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.460
She was always upset about that.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.400
She ignored me completely.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:40.480
I can only remember the anxiety and fear of being locked up in the storehouse for days.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.120
My brothers weren't fond of me either.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:48.490
As the youngest prince, my existence was forgotten from the beginning.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:52.560
They thought I was the perfect target for bullying and releasing their frustrations.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.490
That's awful.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:59.920
When I'm alone in the darkness, I start to remember things.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.160
Horrible memories come back to me.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.630
I don't like to be alone.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.400
If Shuurei's there, even the darkness...!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.450
Who's that?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.870
He's here.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.350
You're gonna see something interesting now.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.350
Ryuuki!

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:06.780
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.150
Thank you.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.160
You must've been scared in this darkness.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:20.860
If Shuurei's there, even the darkness won't scare me.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.090
I'm so glad for you.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:34.680
Shuurei!

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.490
Hey! Wake up!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.450
Shuurei! Shuurei!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.690
This is an unknown poison.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.650
At this rate, your Consort will...

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:45.630
Stop joking!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.650
Were you about to say that Shuurei will...?!

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:51.080
What do you need for an antidote?!

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.400
I'll get anything!

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:56.430
Please, Your Highness, I don't even know what the poison is!

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:58.810
You're the best doctor in this country!

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:01.370
If you don't know, then who else does?!

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:05.790
I won't let you do this, Shuurei!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.300
You mustn't go beyond my reach!

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:11.300
You mustn't go where I can never hold you!

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.030
I'll never let you do that!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.430
You might be able to get hold of the antidote.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.230
Give me the antidote!

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:30.230
In exchange, I'll grant you the one wish that you truly desire.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:34.500
What I truly desire, you said?

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.990
That's why you've done this, haven't you?!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.580
I...

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:44.460
will become an Emperor that you'll approve of!

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:52.300
On no account should you forget those words.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:55.590
An Emperor never lies!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:02.250
I thought I'd become an Emperor.

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:11.310
Honestly, he's such a handful for an Emperor.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.220
Y-Y-Y-YOU!

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.130
In public as well!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:34.980
Wait and see. You'll be back here in no time.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:39.640
Starting with the next National Exam,
I'm thinking of accepting female applicants.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.510
What?

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.270
I'd like to introduce the idea of

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.690
female candidates for the National Exam.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.010
Are you still sitting at your desk?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.430
You're really sticking to this, aren't you?

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:59.810
I don't get to see Shuurei much, and I miss her, but I want to pass this bill as soon as possible!

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:02.600
From mixed motives, one might say.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.720
What are you talking about?!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.670
This world is made up of men and women.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:10.170
The days of men governing the country by themselves are now in the past!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:15.060
Opening up opportunities for women to
become officials will benefit the country!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.840
Wait for me, Shuurei!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.100
I've decided to sneak into Shuurei's house tonight.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:23.810
Sneak into her house?!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.670
Indeed.

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:29.810
I've written a letter to Shouka about this, and he's said he doesn't mind.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:32.190
So, what exactly did Your Highness write in the letter?

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.200
"I'm going to visit you one evening.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:38.500
If possible, I'd like to eat one of Shuurei's dinners and then listen to her play the erhu.

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:41.820
I'd be grateful if I could spend an evening with Shouka and Seiran.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:45.370
I'm free in the evening, four days from now. Does that work?"

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.130
That's far from sneaking into a woman's room to sleep with her!

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:50.500
That's just visiting a house, Your Highness.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:57.420
She's got a fever.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.890
S-Surely this can be forgiven.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.810
Shuurei, what's wrong?

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:33.040
Umm... No... I mean...

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.960
You misunderstand me.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.460
Misunderstand...

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.350
Why do you want to be an official even though you're a woman?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.070
Forgive me, Your Highness,

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:53.900
but even if Your Highness asks me why a woman wants to be an official,

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.860
I do not have an answer.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:59.360
I have come here to do what I can.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:02.990
Regardless of whether I'm a man or a woman, I would have taken the National Exam.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:07.120
I want to be an official, so that I can protect people.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.990
I've always thought that.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.640
That's why I've taken the National Exam.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.160
To be the Emperor is painful...

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.560
Shuurei.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:35.020
Finally, Candidate To and Candidate Kou, come forward.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:46.950
To Eigetsu, this year's first-place candidate, and Kou Shuurei, the third-place candidate,

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:51.120
I appoint the two of you as joint governors of Sashuu.

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:57.070
As you two know, Sashuu is a perilous place.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:13:03.780
All measures will be taken, but I cannot ensure your safety.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.130
Even so, will both of you go there as provincial governors?

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:07.930
Yes, sir!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:13.270
I am honored to be in your service.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:19.310
Well then, I shall give you the seal and jewel, the regalia of the Sashuu governor's office.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:23.290
In addition, I have another gift for you.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:26.700
These flowers, from me to both of you.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:28.990
Flower buds...

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:32.430
They signify infinite possibilities and hope.

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:37.120
I am looking forward to seeing what kind of flowers you turn out to be.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:43.250
When you have managed to make your flower buds bloom, I will give you the blossoms.

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:54.540
A report has arrived from Sashuu.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:57.290
The arrival ceremony was peaceful.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:01.360
It says the two of them are doing well.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.570
I see.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:07.150
I hope that Sashuu will now have a bright future.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.710
You can count on them, don't you think?

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.880
They will make things happen.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:17.650
They have Rou Ensei and Tei Yuushun as assistants, and Seiran as well.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:18.930
True.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.040
By the way,

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:26.060
who's going to bring the New Year's greetings from Sashuu?

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:50.530
Huh?

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:52.480
Why?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.720
What about you?

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:58.710
I come here every night. I...

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:02.210
I've been here every night since you returned from Sashuu.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:11.510
I'm home...

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.390
Ryuuki.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.380
Shuurei...

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:17.890
Huh? It's warm.

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:22.420
There's a fire.

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:23.230
Umm...

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:25.900
Did you guys start a fire for me?

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:29.270
Are you the masters of Kyuusai Cove?

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.160
Would you like to eat these with me?

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.660
I thought I'd become the Emperor.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:43.410
But was I really an Emperor?

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.170
In the end...

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.720
Are things going well?

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:57.920
An urgent conference will be held at the court tomorrow.

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:04.170
Once her task in Kiyou is over,
she'll depart immediately, won't she?

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:08.110
No matter how dangerous it is, oujo-sama will leave for sure.

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:11.280
"Don't go..." I can say that.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.240
I have the power to stop her too...

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:17.240
but Shuurei wouldn't want that.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:21.470
It would be such a relief if we could say, "Don't go."

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:25.340
I have to go.

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:28.750
Even if your action will provoke Jyasen-kyou?

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:35.760
To settle the matter, I must confront those who are spreading the rumor.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:40.030
A treatment has been found, and we are fully prepared to battle this disease.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:44.500
What remains now is for me to take measures against Jyasen-kyou on the spot.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:49.010
To Eigetsu and I lack experience.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:51.240
That's why the two of us are joint governors.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:55.610
Where do you expect I would be, and what do you expect I would do, other than be in Sashuu?

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.990
No matter what is said, or by whom, for the sake of the official rank that I was given...

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:04.900
and for the sake of this flower, I will return to Sashuu.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:16.080
If it turns out that the disease breakout was your fault, you said you would take measures against it.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:19.400
To begin with, I will venture into Jyasen-kyou territory.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:20.290
That is too dangerous!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.310
You will be putting your life at risk!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.810
You are a governor. What about your duties?

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:28.500
I have considered that already. Please do not worry.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.690
I will fulfill my duty as a governor.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.540
Sashuu was beginning to show signs of peace.

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:41.240
I cannot overlook those who would cause disorder!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.450
I will give an order to dispatch the army!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.450
Please hold on a moment!

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:50.250
As a Governor of Sashuu, I refuse the offer of intervention by the Imperial Army.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:55.030
Use of the Imperial Army will solve the problem with Jyasen-kyou by force.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:58.590
But, how many lives will be lost that way?

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:03.430
Giving priority to saving people's lives, I will bring this problem to an end!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:11.330
I am the Emperor of Saiunkoku...

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:22.690
Very well, I will not dispatch the army.

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:28.580
Go and accomplish what you need to,
Sashuu Governor Kou Shuurei!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.580
Yes, Your Highness.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.600
I'm upset.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.260
Wha— you're here?

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:46.520
What's wrong with me being here?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.030
This is my palace.

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:50.980
You're in an odd mood.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:54.980
For the last few days, I've only been served meat from morning to evening.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:19:01.790
Ah, because the medical team is practicing surgery on all the pigs and cows they could find...

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.850
But you had some fish too, didn't you?

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.620
It doesn't matter. They're all meat after all.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.680
I wanted to eat vegetables!

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.390
I'm upset!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.380
I hate Shuurei!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.880
Ryuuki...

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:18.190
Shuurei doesn't understand a man's feelings, that painful longing.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:21.960
That's why no one will want to marry Shuurei except me.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:24.340
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:28.410
When I get back, I'll cook you your favorite vegetable dishes.

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:32.150
This is the first time you've said you hate me.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.300
Well, it's not like I'm going there to die.

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:35.730
I'll manage somehow.

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:40.370
You said you'll cook me vegetable dishes?

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:41.070
Yes.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:44.320
I want to eat delicious Sashuu vegetable dishes.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.320
Of course.

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:55.790
I don't hate you. It was a lie.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.350
I'll be waiting.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:12.440
Of course, I've always made choices that I thought were correct for an Emperor.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:16.760
This is delicious.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:27.110
To Eigetsu and Kou Shuurei are relieved of their positions as provincial governors immediately.

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:31.200
The current Kokushuu governor, Kai Yu, will assume this office.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.510
Regarding To Eigetsu, he is demoted.

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.910
Kai Yu will be his guardian.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:40.130
He will be Kai Yu's pupil, assisting with the work and devoting himself to his studies.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:44.380
Th-Then what about the punishment for Officer Kou?

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:48.670
After the transition, she will return to Kiyou immediately.

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:52.560
Her official rank will be revoked, and she will be suspended.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:57.400
She will remain as a joukan until she is appointed to her next position.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:02.360
Shuurei understood my decision as the Emperor.

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:07.690
You bastard! Suspension?! Cut the crap!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:13.870
That'll do. That's all there is.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:19.400
In the end, maybe I only thought about Shuurei.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:24.880
Can I truly say that I've done my duty as Emperor of Saiunkoku?

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:30.530
Haven't I pushed everything on Shuurei, my brother, Shuuei, and Kouyuu,

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:34.350
and run away from my responsibilities as the Emperor?

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:37.640
I'm going to Ranshuu.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:40.440
I'm leaving Tei Yuushun in charge.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:43.020
Why? You're the Emperor, remember?

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:45.620
Don't go running around when we're not even at war.

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:46.950
It's important.

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:49.750
To you as a person?

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:51.510
Or as the Emperor?

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:53.200
If you're going, then make a distinction between the two.

00:21:56.670 --> 00:22:00.220
To me as a person, or to me as an Emperor...

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:06.080
I couldn't answer, because I was running away.

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:08.800
I ran even though I shouldn't have,

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:11.440
and I ran away again.

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:13.700
I ran all the way to Ranshuu.

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:19.310
I want to meet Shuuei, but I can't see him in this condition.

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:20.920
Your Highness...

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:27.030
That's right, I can't see him until I find out who I am.

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:30.930
I'm fed up with running away!

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:33.560
No matter how often I do it, I don't feel any better.

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:34.830
That's why,

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:41.630
for nobody else's sake but mine, I'm going to the shrine that only the true Emperor can reach!

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:48.880
I'm now... quite high up the mountain.

00:22:55.280 --> 00:22:57.140
This must be...

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.640
Did something happen to Ryuuki?

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:27.020
Please be safe.

00:24:45.290 --> 00:24:48.290
Ah, we've finally arrived at Kyuusai Cove.

00:24:48.290 --> 00:24:51.770
Swift currents and waterfalls... Isn't it splendid to be alive?

00:24:51.770 --> 00:24:53.880
Now, let's go find Ryuuki!

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:57.220
Huh? Someone is approaching. Is that... Shun-san?!
